            "created_at": "2025-08-27T14:55:11.135444+00:00",
            "notes": "ok so here's the dealio... qp builds don't go further than round 5, so this is it.\n\nfor our last power we have lots of options!  if you took serenity first round, ignore this and swap for threads of fate here.  now, if you are ressing consistently (congratulations) i'd take  [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d).  if not i'd say go serenity or  [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1).  take serenity only if you're struggling to live.  if not, take distortion to give you more room to push dmg boost while using whambulance.  \n\ni personally have rly liked surging my dps (like a genji after dash or during blade) and then pushing dmg boost while i fly to them.  they get heals from whambulance + life steal. it's rly fun and i highly recommend it.",
